#: ../../monitoring/contacts.rst:2
msgid "Contacts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../monitoring/contacts.rst:4
msgid ""
"To configure user notifications, a contact must first be created in "
"``Monitoring > Contacts``. These contacts can be one of a few types:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../monitoring/contacts.rst:6
msgid "**Contact:** Used for either Email or SMS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../monitoring/contacts.rst:7
msgid ""
"**Web Hook:** Used for posting a notification to a web endpoint or Alert "
"Ops"
msgstr ""

#: ../../monitoring/contacts.rst:8
msgid ""
"**Slack Hook:** Used for posting notifications to a Slack channel (ex. "
"https://slack.com/[Slack])"
msgstr ""

#: ../../monitoring/contacts.rst:9
msgid ""
"**VictorOps:** Provides a web post format consistent with the required "
"notification format for Victor Ops."
msgstr ""

#: ../../monitoring/contacts.rst:11
msgid ""
"Most of these options provide convenient examples and information when "
"configuring the contact. Once they are configured, contacts can freely be"
" used to build `Alert Rules`."
msgstr ""

